## Claim
Text: "Due to Imran Khan's criticism of Macron's comments on Islam, French authorities cancelled the visas of 183 Pakistani citizens and deported 118 from the country."
Claim author: Consulate General Of Pakistan France
Claim date: October 31, 2020
Claim origin: https://web.archive.org/web/20201113115127/https://twitter.com/pakconsulatefr/status/1322495811993903104

## Initial Q&A
